  "content": "<p><strong><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/v2c2m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/v2c2m</a><br><br>我們有奔跑者了！</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/392be00b0aa291d1f2cbb802d5d6dde4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1120\" height=\"156\"><br></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>本模組旨在透過調整殭屍的AI，使其符合末日遊戲風格，為玩家帶來殭屍末日氛圍，且無需新增實體，完美融入遊戲。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/c49eee74606de00949c592b6f134ec16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"602\" height=\"327\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>設定檔現已推出！！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. 燃燒的殭屍將獲得更高速度。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. 現在將新增2種新型殭屍。（相同實體，但AI不同）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. 普通殭屍現在會隨機衝刺，使追蹤目標時的行為更多樣化。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">4. 本模組適用於所有殭屍類型：屍殼、沉屍、殭屍村民及普通殭屍。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">5. 沉屍在強化時也會獲得游泳增益與速度提升。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">6. 由於殭屍大幅強化，本模組也會同步強化鐵魔像與雪人。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">------------------------------------------------<strong>殭屍AI類型-</strong>----------------------------------------------------</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>1. 奔跑者</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">持續高速奔跑，且成群生成</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">註：小殭屍無法獲得此增益。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更新：最新版本中，無目標時它們甚至會四處遊蕩</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>2. 衝撞者</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衝向目標並擊暈、削弱目標。（對鐵魔像造成額外傷害）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">提示：可格擋將其擊退至遠處</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>3. 步行者（普通殭屍）</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>隨機向目標衝刺。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>------------------------<strong>特定事件觸發的殭屍類型</strong></strong><strong>---------------------------------</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>1. 燃燒殭屍</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>殭屍燃燒時獲得更高速度，行動極度不規律</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>2. 沼澤殭屍</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>殭屍潮濕時有機率造成緩速效果</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>3. 掠奪殭屍</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>殭屍裝備劍或斧時，衝刺時間更長且更強力</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>4. 騎乘殭屍（需安裝殭屍馬生成模組）</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>騎乘殭屍馬時提升速度與防禦。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>還能為範圍內其他殭屍提供速度或抗性增益。</strong></span></p><p>------------------------------------------------<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>鐵魔像</em></span><strong>-</strong>----------------------------------------------------</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. 現在具備範圍傷害</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. 可擊退成群敵人</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. 抵抗虛弱效果</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">4. 鐵魔像對物理傷害具備高裝甲值</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">----------------------------------<span style=\"font-size:24px\">雪人</span>--------------------------------------------</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. 現在具備範圍傷害。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. 緩速敵人。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. 可投擲冰凍炸彈，大範圍凍結敵人。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">4. 若被友方攻擊會自我恢復。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">5. 雪球現在僅對選定敵人造成傷害。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><p><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>運作原理？</strong></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>殭屍生成時，模組會隨機分配一種AI。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>1. 奔跑者：僅成群生成（生成時將半徑5格內另一普通殭屍轉為奔跑者）（群體越大，成為奔跑者的機率越高）</strong></span></p><p>成為奔跑者）</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>2. 步行者殭屍：正常生成</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>3. 衝撞者殭屍：正常生成</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-----------------------------</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>為提升真實性，特殊殭屍生成機率幾乎與普通殭屍持平。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>殭屍村民更易轉變為特殊感染體</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>部分殭屍會出現異常移動模式</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">------------------------------------------------------</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>相容性</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>1. 完全相容所有AI生物模組。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>2. 未使用新實體，代表任何修改殭屍實體的模組皆可運作。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>3. 安裝殭屍馬生成模組後會出現新型殭屍。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-horse-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-horse-spawn</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">------------------------------------------------------</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>展示影片</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6wgUlO2b6Yk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>----------------------致謝----------------------------</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>西班牙文翻譯：Texaliuz</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>--------------------------------------------------------</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/red_tofu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/red_tofu</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">請支持我</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.howtogeek.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Patreon-2.jpg?width=1200&amp;trim=1,1&amp;bg-color=000&amp;pad=1,1\" alt=\"\" width=\"718\" height=\"331\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若有興趣，歡迎成為我的Patreon贊助者 :D</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝tryaq_修正文法：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎在此贊助！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/brokencamerastuds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/479710/description_9b1bd023-0d20-4571-a75f-16ca1efc9b7d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"373\" height=\"210\"></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>我幾乎免費製作此模組，若有贊助將不勝感激！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>使用材質包：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tissous-zombie-pack-optifine-1-7x-1-16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tissous-zombie-pack-optifine-1-7x-1-16</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
